   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Curvas de Transferencia \u2014 EGOFET\n",
    "\n",
    "An\u00e1lisis de curvas $I_{DS}$ vs $V_{GS}$ a $V_{DS}$ constante.\n",
    "De aqu\u00ed extraemos: $V_{th}$, movilidad, $SS$, relaci\u00f3n $I_{on}/I_{off}$."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 11,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
